            <ArticleTitle>Granulomatous hypophysitis: presentation and MRI appearance.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1062-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Granulomatous hypophysitis (GrHy) is a relatively rare inflammatory disease compared with lymphocytic hypophysitis. Only a few cases with magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) findings have been reported to date. We describe the MRI findings for two patients with GrHy with unusual histories and clinical outcomes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
